# The hits of buildtools/CheckNoJni.java that US-074 puts out of scope, and nothing else.
#
# One entry per line: path | rule | text | reason
#   path    the file, relative to the repository root, with / separators
#   rule    the rule id the check reports (R-NATIVE, R-EXPORT, R-JNI, R-INCLUDE, R-JDKINC, R-JAVAC-H, R-LOAD)
#   text    text of the source line that contains the whole matched token; an entry covers every hit of
#           that rule in that file whose line has this text around the token
#   reason  why it stays, naming the Out of scope item of US-074 it falls under
# An entry that covers no hit fails the check (exit 2): remove it when its hit goes.

# A runtime-visible message, which US-074 keeps unchanged.
modules/javafx.graphics/src/main/native-glass/mac/GlassApplication.m | R-JNI | NewObjectArray failed in GlassApplication_application | runtime-visible message (Out of scope: the "NewObjectArray failed" message of GlassApplication.m)

